"%(name)s: the location must be an active internal stock of the same company."
msgstr "%(name)s: مکان باید انبار داخلی فعال از همان شرکت باشد."

#. module: maintenance_shareholder_equipment
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/maintenance_shareholder_equipment/models/maintenance_equipment.py:0
