"%(name)s: the return location must be an active internal physical stock of "
"the same company."
msgstr "%(name)s: مکان بازگشت باید انبار داخلی فیزیکی فعال از همان شرکت باشد."

#. module: maintenance_shareholder_equipment
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/maintenance_shareholder_equipment/models/maintenance_equipment.py:0
